        "original_id": "fae41e00-d7c0-5b4e-a849-665cbb8a12a5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Cervecería Nacional Dominicana, Ambev\n- Products: Presidente\n- Places: Dominican Republic, Brazil\n- Events: Brahma–Antarctica merger\n\nFacts:\n- On July 1, 1999, Ambev was created through the merger of the breweries Brahma and Antarctica.\n- Ambev, formally Companhia de Bebidas das Américas, is a Brazilian brewing company.\n- Cervecería Nacional Dominicana is the primary beer producer in the Dominican Republic.\n- Cervecería Nacional Dominicana is owned by Ambev and Grupo León Jimenes.\n- Presidente is a Pilsner beer brand owned and produced by Cervecería Nacional Dominicana.\n- Cervecería Nacional Dominicana produces Presidente at several breweries in the Dominican Republic.",
